38399>>>                Case Break
38400>>>
38400>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38400>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
38400>>>                Send ShowInfoBox ("vengo undefined " + Name(hoInvokingObject))
38401>>>
38401>>>        Case End
38401>>>
38401>>>    End_Procedure
